step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Lady Servil</col> told me that <col=800000>General Khazard</col> has kidnapped her husband and son and forced them to fight in his arena. I need a disguise to get into the arena.</col>
step	2	2	After getting the armour
line	<str>Lady Servil told me that General Khazard has kidnapped her husband and son and forced them to fight in his arena.</str>
line	<col=000080>I took a set of <col=800000>Khazard armour</col> from a chest in the guards' quarters. Wearing it, I should talk to the <col=800000>Head Guard</col>.</col>
step	3	3	After speaking to the Head Guard
line	<str>Lady Servil told me that General Khazard has kidnapped her husband and son and forced them to fight in his arena.</str>
line	<str>I took a set of Khazard armour from a chest in the guards' quarters.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Head Guard</col> let slip that he loves <col=800000>Khali brew</col>. I should buy some from the <col=800000>Khazard barman</col>.</col>
step	4	4	After buying the brew
